{"unit_id":"tag:0AHF:proof","translation":"我们由概形（schemes）的对应结论推出此结论。具体地，该问题在平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）拓扑下关于<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>是局部的（空间的态射（Morphisms），引理<REF_0001>）。因此可以假设<MATH_0003>和<MATH_0004>为仿射概形（affine schemes）。由于<MATH_0005>是开的（open）（空间的态射（Morphisms），引理<REF_0002>），可以选取仿射概形（affine scheme）<MATH_0006>及平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）态射（morphism）<MATH_0007>，使得复合（composition）<MATH_0008>是满射的（surjective）。此时结论由下降（Descent），引理<REF_0003>得到。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"空间的态射"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开的"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"空间的态射"},{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"对应结论的对象，未批准。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"局部拓扑，未批准。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"空间的态射","context":"引用章名，未批准。"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"局部化后的对象，未批准。"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开的","context":"映射性质，未批准。"},{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"覆盖对象，未批准。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"覆盖性质，未批准。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"覆盖箭头，未批准。"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合","context":"箭头复合，未批准。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的","context":"复合性质，未批准。"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降","context":"引用章节，未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
